  "description": "Reusable mixin: volcanic ground ringed by ash around a lava lake with an obsidian island, and a lava river pouring out of it. The land scorches toward it: ash plains thicken the closer you get, and the lava river's banks are burned. A theme that pulls it in can override any piece by id (e.g. move the lake with a new `at`).",
